19: //   - the process endpoint: the loopback address *this* process is serving on.
20: //     The old store kept the same value in package-level state; it lives here so
21: //     the binding path keeps working when the mesh is disabled (--mesh=false) or
22: //     the node record could not be written (MN1).
23: //
